</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>His Father and our Father,</l><l>His God and ours Thou art;</l><l>And He is Thy Beloved,</l><l>The gladness of Thy heart.</l><l>We’re His, in joy He brings us</l><l>To share His part and place,</l><l>To know Thy love and favor,</l><l>The shining of Thy face.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy love that now enfolds us</l><l>Can ne’er wax cold or dim;</l><l>In Him that love doth center,</l><l>And we are loved in Him.</l><l>In Him Thy love and glory</l><l>Find their eternal rest;</l><l>The many sons—His brethren—</l><l>In Him, how near, how blest!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
